window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They found me nearly dead. To save me, they had to turn me...</b></p> <p>When I moved to New York after a bad divorce, I planned to reinvent myself. I just had no idea the \"new me\" would be a vampire. Or that the three (yes, three!) vampires who turned me would be the hottest, most frustrating men I’d ever met.</p> <p>Now, creepy shadow monsters are stalking me, and I don’t know why. But teaming up with these dangerously sexy brothers may be my best chance for survival, even though being around them does weird things to my heart.</p> <p>The old me was too scared to even start dating again.</p> <p>The new me?</p> <p>She wants to devour all three of them.</p> <p><b>Please note:</b> This is the first book in The Vampires' Fae Series, a medium-burn reverse harem story intended for ages 18 and above. This audiobook contains strong language, sexual situations, and a heroine who doesn't have to choose between her men. This series is now complete!</p>"; 
